1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:03,573
Use the cloud menu to fit the session to your phone.

2
00:00:03,582 --> 00:00:07,800
Both screens now use forty-nine columns and thirty-eight rows.

3
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:10,610
Enter commands on the phone.

4
